  "\u003cstrong\u003eAssigned\u003c/strong\u003e counts nodes classification sends to a repo's environments; \u003cstrong\u003ereporting\u003c/strong\u003e counts nodes that last ran from one. They are shown separately because the gap between them is the useful signal.": "\u003cstrong\u003e已分配\u003c/strong\u003e统计分类规则将其送往某仓库 Environments 的 Nodes；\u003cstrong\u003e上报中\u003c/strong\u003e统计最近从其中一个 Environment 运行过的 Nodes。两者分开显示，因为它们之间的差距才是有用的信号。",
  "A node can match several groups at once. Their classes and parameters are combined; when two groups set the \u003cem\u003esame\u003c/em\u003e class parameter, top-scope parameter, or environment, the one with the higher priority wins. Priorities must be unique.": "一个 Node 可以同时匹配多个组。它们的类和参数会合并；当两个组设置了\u003cem\u003e相同的\u003c/em\u003e类参数、顶层作用域参数或 Environment 时，优先级高者胜出。优先级必须唯一。",
  "A node joins this group when its facts satisfy \u003cem\u003eevery\u003c/em\u003e condition below. Fact path is a dotted path into the node's facts, like \u003ccode\u003eos.family\u003c/code\u003e or \u003ccode\u003enetworking.fqdn\u003c/code\u003e — open a node's page to see the facts it reports. With no conditions and no pinned nodes, the group matches nothing.": "当一个 Node 的 Facts 满足下方\u003cem\u003e每一项\u003c/em\u003e条件时，它就加入本组。Fact 路径是指向 Node 的 Facts 的点分隔路径，例如 \u003ccode\u003eos.family\u003c/code\u003e 或 \u003ccode\u003enetworking.fqdn\u003c/code\u003e — 打开某个 Node 的页面即可查看其上报的 Facts。若既无条件也无固定 Nodes，则本组不匹配任何对象。",
